# Elm: Elm syntax guide (elm-lang.org/docs/syntax) and Elm 0.19 core; requirements/languages/elm.md
name     elm

keyword  if then else case of let in type alias module exposing import as port where
builtin  True False Just Nothing Ok Err identity always not toString Debug List Maybe Result String

line-comment   --
block-comment  {- -}  : nested
string   """ """  : escapes multiline
string   " "      : escapes
escape        : u-braces
number        : no-leading-dot
operators  +-*/%^&|<>=:.!
upper-type
hook     apostrophe
